# A save loaded in its game and from its file (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC5; it replaces --save-check): terran01's
# tips closed, its steps run until a trigger portrait keeps the local player's triggers waiting; paused, the view at
# the map's bottom-right, the game saved; the view at the top-left, then the save loaded in the game and from its file
# (the glue's Load Saved). The frame of each load shows the saved view, the minimap's view at its tile and the saved
# step, and the loaded game's trigger wait ends once the portrait's time left has passed (3 s more at most). The
# save's file goes at the end. tools/ci.sh wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
mission terran/terran01
options originals

wait game
until nodialog key Return
wait tick >= 48 and trigger.waiting == 1 and portrait.ms > 0
pause
camera max
wait frames 3
mark saved
log saved camera.x camera.y camera.tile.x camera.tile.y tick portrait.ms
save "koprulu save check"
wait frames 3
camera 0 0
wait frames 30
load "koprulu save check"
include save_verify.kps
shot in-game
wait trigger.waiting == 0 within @saved.portrait.ms + 3000
load-file "koprulu save check"
include save_verify.kps
shot from-file
wait trigger.waiting == 0 within @saved.portrait.ms + 3000
check save-file "koprulu save check"
